{"ID":"20250919105439-w4iknm1","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250919105439-w4iknm1","title":"UPL6-3——静态批处理","type":"doc","updated":"20250919150222"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919150117-1w9eocs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250919150117-1w9eocs","updated":"20250919150222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250919150121-0lduss3","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250919150121-0lduss3","updated":"20250919150222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"StaticBatchingUtility.Combine()\t\t// 传入要进行静态合批的根对象，将其下的对象执行一次静态合批\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250919105439-7ovjcxi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250919105439-7ovjcxi","updated":"20250919110817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静态批处理"}]},{"ID":"20250919105514-2x6tgl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919105514-2x6tgl4","updated":"20250919105525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静态批处理（Static Batching）是 Unity 用来减少 CPU Draw Call 开销的一种批处理方式\n它将多个静态对象（位置、旋转、缩放都不会在运行中改变的物体）的网格数据合并成一个或少量的大网格，从而一次性提交给 GPU 绘制"}]},{"ID":"20250919105529-rmi83oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919105529-rmi83oy","updated":"20250919105538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前提条件：想要进行静态批处理的物体需要勾选 Static 中的 Batching Static（Inspector 窗口右上角）"}]},{"ID":"20250919105803-byi4m63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919105803-byi4m63","updated":"20250919105803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250919105803-di6eo1s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250919105540-lmq47rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919105540-lmq47rh","updated":"20250919110150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要原理：\nUnity 会在构建或首次运行时，把使用相同材质的静态物体的网格数据合并成更大的网格\n在渲染时，这些静态物体就能通过一次 DrawCall 一起绘制，而不是每个物体单独一个DrawCall"}]},{"ID":"20250919110152-264mivf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110152-264mivf","updated":"20250919110209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：静态批处理是一种在构建或者第一次运行时，对场景上勾选了 Batching Static 的物体进行网格合并\n将多个静态物体网格会合并成一个大网格，一次性提交给 GPU，从而减少 Draw Call 的技术"}]},{"ID":"20250919110214-4zo6irz","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250919110214-4zo6irz","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250919110228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250919110228-ynx8gv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110228-ynx8gv8","updated":"20250919110228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20250919110216-sv3tme4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919110216-sv3tme4","updated":"20250919110216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919110216-9p42w3f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919110216-9p42w3f","updated":"20250919110216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919110216-088bceh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110216-088bceh","updated":"20250919110216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静态批处理并不会像动态批处理一样，每帧都去合批"}]},{"ID":"20250919110218-nmtpk87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110218-nmtpk87","updated":"20250919110218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而是在构建或者第一次运行时进行一次网格合并，之后每帧都提交同一个大网格而不会再去动态合并了"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919110216-z5rv0w3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250919110216-z5rv0w3","updated":"20250919110216"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919110216-t888ijc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110216-t888ijc","updated":"20250919110216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静态批处理需要在运行后才能看到效果"}]},{"ID":"20250919110219-c9oyjex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110219-c9oyjex","updated":"20250919110225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而不是像动态批处理一样，没运行时也能看到 DrawCall 的减少"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250919110259-t7t0b8b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250919110259-t7t0b8b","updated":"20250919110817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何开启静态批处理"}]},{"ID":"20250919110305-c50fmwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110305-c50fmwr","updated":"20250919110308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般静态批处理功能都是默认开启的，不管在内置渲染管线 还是 SRP 中"}]},{"ID":"20250919110305-2tymg4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110305-2tymg4u","updated":"20250919110305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Player Settings ——\u003e Other Settings ——\u003e Rendering ——\u003e Static Batching"}]},{"ID":"20250919110317-bg6tcmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110317-bg6tcmt","updated":"20250919110416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250919110416-nwgzdl9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250919110421-po0dx5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110421-po0dx5r","updated":"20250919110421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设场景上有 5 个使用相同材质的对象"}]},{"ID":"20250919110421-33zev9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919110421-33zev9a","updated":"20250919110421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style"